Some very strange things are happening. I copied all the original files to 
another subdirectory and I got some errors that I did not get before with 
the same files on the same server but in another directory. I was able to 
correct these errors by changing "include" to "include_once" in a couple of 
PHP files. However, then I tried the files that gave me a lot of errors 
yesterday in the second directory and they worked just fine. In any case, I 
created a new jboselkei with a blank database at 
http://lojban.qx11.info/jboselkei-test/ . It would help me out if people 
wouldn't mind creating an account with that test jboselkei and adding 3-5 
posts, 3-5 translations, and 3-5 reviews. They don't have to be real posts. 
They can be nonsense or random text. Doing this would create a database of 
the right size for me to work with. Thanks.

